    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Heavy Armor Training)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Constitution or Strength score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Damage Reduction.</strong> When an attack hits you while you're wearing Heavy armor, any Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage the attack deals to you is reduced by your Proficiency Bonus.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-RWYdO8GoIXOqDZiy\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Reduce the damage yourself (or with the damage application of the chat card).</p></section>",
